(7676028, 1254738, 138630, '<td valign="top">This kind of farming fascinates me.  I''ve seen landscapes of greater expanse, but the closer look featuring the worker is highly effective.  Love the glimpse we get of the far side of this terraced valley . . . and of the mountains beyond.  Beautifully composed.  Unusual.  Artistic. Authentic.  This is one of my few 10''s.  (Voted earlier)</td>', 'This kind of farming fascinates me.  I''ve seen landscapes of greater expanse, but the closer look featuring the worker is highly effective.  Love the glimpse we get of the far side of this terraced valley . . . and of the mountains beyond.  Beautifully composed.  Unusual.  Artistic. Authentic.  This is one of my few 10''s.  (Voted earlier)', '2020-10-07 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676029, 1254706, 138630, '<td valign="top">Much drama here.  For "people in landscape", one of the things I was looking for when I entered and voted was some kind of purpose or relationship - a reason for the person being there.  This one fits the bill perfectly.  He is one with the terrain and it with him; and he gives us a fine sense of scale.  Well done.  10.  (Voted earlier)</td>', 'Much drama here.  For "people in landscape", one of the things I was looking for when I entered and voted was some kind of purpose or relationship - a reason for the person being there.  This one fits the bill perfectly.  He is one with the terrain and it with him; and he gives us a fine sense of scale.  Well done.  10.  (Voted earlier)', '2020-10-07 00:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676030, 1254670, 138630, '<td valign="top">Perfect depth of field and tonal range for me and a landscape setting that is both unusual and starkly beautiful.  Great pop of color in the red jackets.  10  (Voted earlier)</td>', 'Perfect depth of field and tonal range for me and a landscape setting that is both unusual and starkly beautiful.  Great pop of color in the red jackets.  10  (Voted earlier)', '2020-10-07 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
